~ start
do SignalManager.cutscene_started.emit()
Theodore: And the lights are back on.
Amelia: Thank goodness. My nightlight. I'm tired.
Amelia: Teddy . . . do you think those monsters are still out there?
Theodore: Even if they are, I'll keep them away.
Theodore: Sleep tight, Amelia.
Amelia: [wave amp=15 freq=5]~Yawn~[/wave] . . . Thanks, Teddy.
Amelia: Good night.
do SignalManager.dialogue_ended.emit()
do SignalManager.end_game.emit()
=> END
